            {
                "entry_id": "e9557c04-2aa8-3312-b058-9446b8e9393e",
                "word": "abstractionist",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "46bdcb53-1339-41f9-ae5d-348cb610d8cf",
                        "entry_id": "e9557c04-2aa8-3312-b058-9446b8e9393e",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "abstractionists"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "22ee0255-6f33-3760-8770-6b31bbd088cb",
                        "entry_id": "e9557c04-2aa8-3312-b058-9446b8e9393e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An idealist."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0e3a6fc-c0cc-4d6e-8ee4-6cc802a5496e",
                                "sense_id": "22ee0255-6f33-3760-8770-6b31bbd088cb",
                                "text": "She punishes abstractionists, and will only forgive an induction which is rare and casual."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "22af4272-1212-469f-aae5-1a119375fcbb",
                                "sense_id": "22ee0255-6f33-3760-8770-6b31bbd088cb",
                                "text": "If you come near them and see what conceits they entertain,—they are abstractionists, and spend their days and nights in dreaming some dream; in expecting the homage of society to some precious scheme, built on a truth, but destitute of proportion in its presentment, of justness in its application, and of all energy of will in the schemer to embody and vitalize it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "791e4a34-7d8d-4525-a204-6fcc8e40e8f5",
                                "sense_id": "22ee0255-6f33-3760-8770-6b31bbd088cb",
                                "text": "In this all-important respect I do not hesitate to say we theorists and abstractionists of the North, throughout that long anti-slavery discussion which ended with the 1861 dash of arms, were thoroughly wrong."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d329cb9e-61e5-3e8c-bc19-89e3dc0efe33",
